          "end": 43.65,
          "en": "Now, whilst ChatGPT indeed can be amazing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.65,
          "end": 47.67,
          "en": "and can be a great help, it also has limitations though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.67,
          "end": 51.39,
          "en": "especially if you have no programming experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
