          "en": "Now it did give me some code, some Python code again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.55,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "which is great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "And the code looks good, I guess.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "I also then asked for how to run this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 72.51,
          "en": "and it gave me some instructions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.51,
          "end": 74.58,
          "en": "But when I tried running that game",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.58,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "I then faced a couple of issues.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 79.05,
          "en": "For example, the game wouldn't really start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.05,
          "end": 81.75,
          "en": "A window would open for a fraction of a second",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
