        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.43,
          "end": 94.53,
          "en": "And that's then where I gave up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.53,
          "end": 97.8,
          "en": "Now, of course, that's a pretty early point to give up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 100.74000000000001,
          "en": "Of course I could have continued asking for help.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.74000000000001,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "I could have said, \"I'm still getting a black screen.\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 106.62,
          "en": "and I would've gotten another version of the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.62,
          "end": 109.14,
          "en": "which hopefully fixed the problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.14,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "But that's exactly the kind of point I wanna make here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 114.87,
          "en": "You can probably get there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.87,
          "end": 117.75,
          "en": "but the more complex the code gets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.75,
          "end": 120.72,
          "en": "the more complex the program gets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.72,
          "end": 125.72,
          "en": "the higher the chance that ChatGPT introduces errors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126,
          "end": 128.46,
          "en": "introduces bugs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 128.46,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "And, of course, it also might write suboptimal code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 133.23,
          "en": "which technically works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 133.23,
          "end": 136.62,
